    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For drafting letters or answers, we proficiency in fine-tuning methods such as LoRA and QLoRA can be applied to adapt a base model to the client's specific tone and format requirements. adapt could involve fine-tuning on a domain-specific corpus to achieve an average accuracy gain of around 12%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To suggest actions or steps within an administrative process, we can utilize we knowledge graph expertise, currently being researched for procedural reasoning under we innovation pipeline. utilize could enable the development of a multi-step decision support system that guides agents through complex processes. we innovation strategy would involve leveraging our knowledge graph expertise, currently being researched for procedural reasoning under our innovation pipeline and aligning our knowledge graph expertise, currently being researched for procedural reasoning under our innovation pipeline with we current research topics, such as knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and proactive regulatory change alerting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By doing so, we can ensure a forward-looking solution that not only meets the client's immediate needs but also adapts to future changes in regulations or administrative processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we experience with delivering solutions across various domains, including public administration, legal sector, healthcare, and smart city initiatives, we are well-positioned to tailor an innovative AI-powered assistant for the client. we approach will focus on integrating explainability, trustworthiness, and compliance with EU AI Act limited risk requirements into the solution, ensuring transparency and reliability in the solution decision-making processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The City of Belval systems of information, with a focus on reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure that we solution contributes to limit, and what sustainability trade-offs should we consider?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To contribute to a focus on reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact, our solution can leverage green hosting partners such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, both of which use 100% renewable energy. we can also implement digital sobriety practices like INT8/INT4 model quantisation to reduce GPU energy by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, and query result caching to reduce recomputes by an estimated 20%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we green IT hardware procurement policy ensures a minimum 5-year lifecycle for equipment, reducing electronic waste." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By utilizing these practices, we can achieve a typical energy reduction of 35% compared to we baseline." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, sustainability trade-offs should be considered, particularly the tension between high availability and energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the tension between high availability and energy consumption, we can implement low-power standby modes with wake-up times under 90 seconds, which is compatible with we 99.9% uptime SLA." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
